From bd21997589c726fabd7c0eb7b0b71c51a84a0c94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Wiegand <benjamin.lineageos@wiegand.pw>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:24:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher3: Support multiple display densities for default grid size

invDistWeightedInterpolate() previously assumed all internal displays
have the same density, which causes problems on foldables which require
their displays to have different densities for usability.

For example: on smith, the inner display density (360 dpi) would be
paired with the outer display resolution (800x600) causing the grid to
be 2x2.

Change-Id: I97b61b7d7bf4fa01bfdb16134cba0d327779b826
---

